  <name>PutiaCNC</name>
  <summary>CNC toolpath studio for GRBL machines</summary>
  <description>
    <p>PutiaCNC is a CAM program for small CNC routers. Draw or import shapes, give them operations (profile, pocket, V-carve, drill, inlay, 3D relief) and preview the result in 2D and 3D before it is cut.</p>
    <p>It writes G-code for GRBL, and also for Mach3, LinuxCNC and Marlin.</p>
  </description>
  <launchable type="desktop-id">putiacnc.desktop</launchable>
